            <div xml:id="d203">

                <pb facs="0317" n="205" xml:id="pg205"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/4732: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Reinsch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1919-06-23T11:15:00-05:00"
                            notBefore="1919-06-21T12:00:00+04:53"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received June 23, 1919, 11:15
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Following from [Harris at] Omsk.</p>
                <p>“279, June 21, noon. Gaida has been
                    superseded by General Dietrichs as
                    commander in chief Siberian armies. Harris.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Reinsch</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
